Package: yogabook-gnss
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, apparmor, gpsd, gpsd-clients, python3, rfkill, systemd
Description: Lenovo Yoga Book YB1-X91L GNSS integration
 Provides the open-source systemd, gpsd, rfkill, UART and import integration
 needed to use the Yoga Book's BCM4752 GNSS receiver on Linux.
 .
 The package deliberately contains no Lenovo, Broadcom or Android binary.
 The owner must import the compatible runtime from their own stock firmware.
